&lt;li&gt;macOS – Announce changes to live regions on macOS by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kirb/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kirb"&gt;@kirb&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4171801173" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/21045" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21045/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21045"&gt;#21045&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Implement &lt;code&gt;DataFormat.CreateInProcessFormat&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/NathanDrake2406/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/NathanDrake2406"&gt;@NathanDrake2406&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4199623876" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/21076" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21076/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21076"&gt;#21076&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
