&lt;li&gt;Windows – fix &lt;code&gt;None/BorderOnly&lt;/code&gt; maximized position on secondary screens by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4234084878" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/21136" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21136/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21136"&gt;#21136&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
